OL,3,GNEWSAFestival 'shines a light' on
OL,4,AScotland's national book town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual celebration of literature
OL,7,Fhas started in Scotland's national book
OL,8,Ftown.
OL,10,FThe Wigtown Book Festival runs across
OL,11,F10 days until 4 October.
OL,13,FIt promises national and international
OL,14,Fguests while also showcasing Galloway
OL,15,Fto a wider audience.
OL,17,FMore than 250 events are taking place
OL,18,Ffeaturing - among others - comedian
OL,19,FLucy Porter, actor Sam Heughan and
OL,20,Fcrime writers Louise Welsh and Chris
OL,21,FBrookmyre.
